{"page":291,"width":1784,"height":2580,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"CHA","words":[{"text":"CHA","x":1286,"y":269,"width":133,"height":35}]},{"text":"/K,孑乞幫","words":[{"text":"/K,孑乞幫","x":392,"y":491,"width":197,"height":74}]},{"text":"222//夕c/5","words":[{"text":"222//夕c/5","x":194,"y":596,"width":239,"height":42}]},{"text":"ER","words":[{"text":"ER","x":1516,"y":269,"width":77,"height":35}]},{"text":"다중 교무 그래밍 환경에서는 여러 스레드가 한정된 자원을 사용하려고 서로 경쟁할 수","words":[{"text":"다중","x":323,"y":805,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"교무","x":410,"y":808,"width":59,"height":25},{"text":"그래밍","x":480,"y":804,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"환경에서는","x":591,"y":805,"width":163,"height":35},{"text":"여러","x":769,"y":805,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"스레드가","x":844,"y":804,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"한정된","x":979,"y":804,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"자원을","x":1084,"y":804,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"사용하려고","x":1192,"y":803,"width":159,"height":36},{"text":"서로","x":1366,"y":804,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"경쟁할","x":1447,"y":803,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1559,"y":804,"width":33,"height":35}]},{"text":"있다. 한 스레드가 자원을 요청했을 때, 그 시각에 그 자원을 사용할 수 없는 상황이 발","words":[{"text":"있다.","x":325,"y":864,"width":72,"height":36},{"text":"한","x":415,"y":864,"width":35,"height":33},{"text":"스레드가","x":464,"y":864,"width":135,"height":35},{"text":"자원을","x":612,"y":864,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"요청했을","x":723,"y":865,"width":127,"height":35},{"text":"때,","x":864,"y":864,"width":37,"height":36},{"text":"그","x":916,"y":869,"width":30,"height":24},{"text":"시각에","x":960,"y":864,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"그","x":1064,"y":868,"width":29,"height":25},{"text":"자원을","x":1106,"y":864,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"사용할","x":1212,"y":863,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1320,"y":864,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"없는","x":1369,"y":864,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"상황이","x":1446,"y":862,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"발","x":1560,"y":862,"width":33,"height":34}]},{"text":"생할 수 있고, 그때는 스레드가 대기 상태로 들어간다. 이처럼 대기 중인 스레드들이 (그","words":[{"text":"생할","x":321,"y":924,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":402,"y":923,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"있고,","x":452,"y":923,"width":73,"height":36},{"text":"그때는","x":540,"y":924,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"스레드가","x":652,"y":924,"width":130,"height":36},{"text":"대기","x":795,"y":924,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"상태로","x":867,"y":923,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"들어간다.","x":971,"y":923,"width":129,"height":37},{"text":"이처럼","x":1116,"y":923,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"대기","x":1220,"y":923,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"중인","x":1293,"y":923,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"스레드들이","x":1370,"y":921,"width":160,"height":38},{"text":"(그","x":1547,"y":924,"width":45,"height":35}]},{"text":"들이 요청한 자원들이 다른 스레드들에 의해서 점유되어 있고 그들도 다 대기 상태에 있","words":[{"text":"들이","x":321,"y":984,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"요청한","x":403,"y":983,"width":103,"height":35},{"text":"자원들이","x":517,"y":983,"width":130,"height":35},{"text":"다른","x":664,"y":984,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"스레드들에","x":740,"y":984,"width":154,"height":34},{"text":"의해서","x":910,"y":983,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"점유되어","x":1015,"y":983,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"있고","x":1149,"y":983,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"그들도","x":1220,"y":984,"width":94,"height":33},{"text":"다","x":1328,"y":984,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"대기","x":1372,"y":983,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"상태에","x":1448,"y":980,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"있","x":1562,"y":980,"width":30,"height":35}]},{"text":"기 때문에) 결코 다시는 그 상태를 변경시길 수 없으면 이런 상황을 교착 상태라 부른다.","words":[{"text":"기","x":323,"y":1045,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"때문에)","x":369,"y":1042,"width":111,"height":38},{"text":"결코","x":498,"y":1042,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"다시는","x":577,"y":1042,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"그","x":688,"y":1048,"width":32,"height":23},{"text":"상태를","x":731,"y":1042,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"변경시길","x":841,"y":1042,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":975,"y":1043,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"없으면","x":1020,"y":1043,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"이런","x":1123,"y":1042,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"상황을","x":1193,"y":1042,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"교착","x":1299,"y":1043,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"상태라","x":1374,"y":1041,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"부른다.","x":1485,"y":1039,"width":107,"height":35}]},{"text":"이미 아에서 라이브니스 장에의 형태로 이 문제를 간략히 논의하였다. 거기서 우리는","words":[{"text":"이미","x":323,"y":1104,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"아에서","x":405,"y":1102,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"라이브니스","x":545,"y":1102,"width":162,"height":36},{"text":"장에의","x":723,"y":1102,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"형태로","x":833,"y":1102,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"이","x":943,"y":1102,"width":25,"height":36},{"text":"문제를","x":986,"y":1103,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"간략히","x":1094,"y":1102,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"논의하였다.","x":1198,"y":1102,"width":165,"height":36},{"text":"거기서","x":1382,"y":1100,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"우리는","x":1494,"y":1098,"width":100,"height":36}]},{"text":"교착 상태를 프로세스 집합 내의 모든 프로세스가 그 집합의 다른 프로세스에 의해서만","words":[{"text":"교착","x":322,"y":1164,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"상태를","x":404,"y":1163,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"프로세스","x":518,"y":1162,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"집합","x":668,"y":1163,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"내의","x":747,"y":1162,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"모든","x":819,"y":1164,"width":65,"height":33},{"text":"프로세스가","x":894,"y":1162,"width":160,"height":36},{"text":"그","x":1063,"y":1168,"width":31,"height":24},{"text":"집합의","x":1109,"y":1162,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"다른","x":1214,"y":1162,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"프로세스에","x":1286,"y":1161,"width":162,"height":38},{"text":"의해서만","x":1461,"y":1158,"width":134,"height":37}]},{"text":"일어날 수 있는 이벤트를 기다리는 상황이라고 정의하였다.","words":[{"text":"일어날","x":327,"y":1224,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":436,"y":1224,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"있는","x":484,"y":1224,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"이벤트를","x":565,"y":1224,"width":130,"height":36},{"text":"기다리는","x":706,"y":1223,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"상황이라고","x":844,"y":1223,"width":158,"height":36},{"text":"정의하였다.","x":1014,"y":1223,"width":159,"height":36}]},{"text":"아마도 교착 상태의 가장 좋은 예는 20세기 초에 캔사스 주 의회가 통과한 법률에서","words":[{"text":"아마도","x":388,"y":1284,"width":102,"height":36},{"text":"교착","x":504,"y":1284,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"상태의","x":584,"y":1284,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"가장","x":698,"y":1284,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"좋은","x":774,"y":1284,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"예는","x":852,"y":1283,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"20세기","x":927,"y":1284,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"초에","x":1036,"y":1284,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"캔사스","x":1110,"y":1284,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"주","x":1210,"y":1285,"width":32,"height":34},{"text":"의회가","x":1254,"y":1284,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"통과한","x":1356,"y":1282,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"법률에서","x":1465,"y":1281,"width":124,"height":36}]},{"text":"찾아볼 수 있다. 그 내펑은 부분적으로 다음과 같다. “두 기자가 교차로에서 서로 접근할 때","words":[{"text":"찾아볼","x":325,"y":1345,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":435,"y":1344,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":483,"y":1344,"width":71,"height":36},{"text":"그","x":566,"y":1350,"width":33,"height":24},{"text":"내펑은","x":611,"y":1344,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"부분적으로","x":716,"y":1344,"width":157,"height":36},{"text":"다음과","x":883,"y":1344,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"같다.","x":986,"y":1344,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"“두","x":1064,"y":1345,"width":42,"height":35},{"text":"기자가","x":1117,"y":1344,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"교차로에서","x":1217,"y":1343,"width":149,"height":36},{"text":"서로","x":1381,"y":1343,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"접근할","x":1456,"y":1342,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"때","x":1561,"y":1342,"width":29,"height":35}]},{"text":"는, 둘 다 완전히 정지해야 하며 상대방이 없어지지 않는 한 누구도 다시 출발할 수 없다.”","words":[{"text":"는,","x":325,"y":1408,"width":41,"height":34},{"text":"둘","x":377,"y":1406,"width":34,"height":34},{"text":"다","x":422,"y":1404,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"완전히","x":465,"y":1404,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"정지해야","x":577,"y":1405,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"하며","x":713,"y":1404,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"상대방이","x":786,"y":1404,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"없어지지","x":921,"y":1405,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"않는","x":1052,"y":1404,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"한","x":1120,"y":1404,"width":32,"height":34},{"text":"누구도","x":1160,"y":1406,"width":92,"height":33},{"text":"다시","x":1261,"y":1404,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"출발할","x":1332,"y":1403,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1434,"y":1403,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"없다.”","x":1479,"y":1402,"width":80,"height":35}]},{"text":"이 장에서 우리는 운영체제 개발자뿐 아니라 펑용 프로그램 개발지들도 교착 상태를","words":[{"text":"이","x":391,"y":1465,"width":28,"height":36},{"text":"장에서","x":436,"y":1464,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"우리는","x":550,"y":1465,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"운영체제","x":660,"y":1465,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"개발자뿐","x":803,"y":1464,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"아니라","x":940,"y":1465,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"펑용","x":1043,"y":1465,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"프로그램","x":1116,"y":1464,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"개발지들도","x":1253,"y":1464,"width":155,"height":36},{"text":"교착","x":1420,"y":1463,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"상태를","x":1495,"y":1463,"width":98,"height":34}]},{"text":"예방하거나 다루기 위해 시용할 수 있는 방법들을 논의한다. 몇몇 응용들은 교착 상태가","words":[{"text":"예방하거나","x":328,"y":1524,"width":170,"height":36},{"text":"다루기","x":510,"y":1525,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"위해","x":624,"y":1525,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"시용할","x":700,"y":1524,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":809,"y":1524,"width":31,"height":36},{"text":"있는","x":855,"y":1524,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"방법들을","x":928,"y":1524,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"논의한다.","x":1063,"y":1524,"width":131,"height":35}